# 幕|镜头|中文字幕|English|可选普通话读音
1|pink|一根原本粉白细长的“小香肠”，|Imagine a slender, pale pink “sausage.”
1|red|为什么会在十几个小时里变成暗红，|In this case, why did it turn dark red in a matter of hours,
1|yellow|又覆上灰黄的脓苔，甚至出现焦黑？|then develop a grey-yellow coat and even black patches?
1|black|这根“小香肠”，其实就是阑尾。|That “sausage” is the appendix.
1|title|今天沿着这本变质日记，读懂炎症保卫战。|Follow its colour changes to see how inflammation unfolds.
1|title|颜色是线索，再看阑尾壁发生了什么。|The colours are clues to what happens inside the appendix wall.
2|noon|午饭后，二十八岁的小伙开始恶心、呕吐。|After lunch, a 28-year-old man feels nauseated and vomits.
2|navel|最初，他只觉得肚脐周围隐隐作痛。|At first, he feels a dull ache around his navel.
2|navel|这是内脏神经传来的痛，定位并不清楚。|Pain carried by visceral nerves is hard to pinpoint.
2|migrate|到了傍晚，疼痛从肚脐周围移向右下腹。|By evening, the pain migrates from the navel to the lower right abdomen.
2|target|炎症累及壁腹膜，疼痛一下变得好定位。|Once the parietal peritoneum is irritated, the pain becomes localised.
2|target|医生检查麦氏点，按压痛，松手时也痛。|At McBurney's point, the clinician finds tenderness and pain on release.
2|fever|到了急诊，他的体温已经升到三十九点三度。|In the emergency department, his temperature is 39.3 °C.
2|fever|白细胞升高，其中中性粒细胞占了大多数。|His white blood cell count is high, with a marked neutrophil predominance.
2|alarm|取出的阑尾肿胀发红，原本的粉白消失了。|The removed appendix has swollen and lost its pale pink colour.
2|alarm|暗红，来自局部血管扩张和充血。|The dark red colour reflects dilated, congested blood vessels.
3|coat|再靠近一点，阑尾表面覆着一层灰黄色脓苔。|Look closer: a grey-yellow coat covers the appendix.
3|open|把阑尾剖开，可见管腔积着浑浊的黄红色脓液。|Cutting it open reveals cloudy, yellow-red pus inside the lumen.
3|open|这样的改变，常见于蜂窝织炎性阑尾炎。|These changes are typical of phlegmonous appendicitis.
3|layers|显微镜下，急性期以变质和渗出为主。|Tissue injury and exudation dominate in the acute phase.
3|mucosa|先看“变质”：管腔可因粪石等原因梗阻。|First comes tissue injury. A faecalith can obstruct the lumen.
3|mucosa|黏膜受损，整齐的上皮出现坏死和破溃。|The orderly mucosal lining breaks down, with necrosis and ulceration.
3|vessel|再看“渗出”：血管扩张，腔内挤满红细胞。|Next, exudation. Vessels dilate and fill with red blood cells.
3|vessel|血浆成分漏进组织，纤维间拉开了距离。|Plasma leaks into tissue, pushing its fibres apart and causing oedema.
3|cells|中性粒细胞从血管游出，细胞核有二到五叶。|Neutrophils leave the vessels. Their nuclei have two to five lobes.
3|cells|在化脓期，它们密集挤进阑尾壁的各层。|In the suppurative stage, they infiltrate every layer of the wall.
3|serosa|最外面的浆膜上，纤维素交织成一张网。|Along the outer serosa, fibrin forms a mesh.
3|serosa|网里裹着变性坏死的中性粒细胞，也叫脓细胞。|The mesh traps degenerating and dead neutrophils, known as pus cells.
3|serosa|这就是纤维素性脓性渗出物，形成灰黄色脓苔。|This fibrinopurulent exudate forms the grey-yellow coat.
4|compare|单纯性到化脓性、坏疽性，是经典演变路径。|Simple, suppurative and gangrenous disease illustrate a classic sequence.
4|compare|这是一条典型路径，并非每个患者都必须经历。|This is a typical progression. Each patient may follow a different course.
4|simple|在早期的单纯性阶段，先看黏膜和黏膜下层。|In early simple appendicitis, look first at the mucosa and submucosa.
4|simple|中性粒细胞主要聚在浅层，越往深处越稀疏。|Neutrophils cluster in the superficial layers and thin out deeper down.
4|simple|到了肌层，只能看到寥寥几个散在的身影。|In the muscle layer, only a few scattered cells come into view.
4|phlegmon|到灰黄的化脓期，细胞已穿过黏膜下层。|In the grey-yellow stage, neutrophils have spread beyond the submucosa.
4|phlegmon|肌束的间隙，也被密集的中性粒细胞填满。|Dense neutrophils pack the spaces between the muscle bundles.
4|thrombus|病情继续恶化时，系膜静脉可形成血栓。|With worsening disease, a thrombus may form in a mesoappendiceal vein.
4|thrombus|一旦血运受损，管壁就可能缺血、坏死、变黑。|Loss of blood supply can lead to ischaemia and blackened, necrotic tissue.
4|rupture|阑尾壁缺血坏死后变薄变脆，严重时侧壁会穿孔。|The necrotic wall becomes thin and fragile. In severe cases its side wall can perforate.
4|rupture|脓液顺着破口流进腹腔，可引发危及生命的腹膜炎。|Pus can leak through the hole and cause life-threatening peritonitis.
5|doctor|医生先看症状和查体，再结合化验判断风险。|Symptoms and examination come first, supported by lab tests.
5|doctor|并非人人都需要做 CT。|Not everyone needs a CT scan.|并非人人都需要做 C T。
5|ctOverview|把三型影像放一起看。|Let's look at all three patterns together.
5|ct0|单纯性可轻度增粗，周围脂肪间隙仍可清晰。|In simple cases, mild enlargement can coexist with clear surrounding fat.
5|ct1|化脓性可见壁增厚强化，周围脂肪呈絮状。|Suppuration can show wall thickening, enhancement and hazy fat stranding.
5|ct2|管壁缺损、少强化，或见积液和气泡，要警惕坏疽穿孔。|A wall defect or weak enhancement can signal gangrene. Fluid or gas can suggest perforation.
5|ct2|三型征象有差异，也会重叠，分型需结合病理。|The imaging patterns can overlap. Subtyping also relies on pathology.
5|ctEvidence|成人初始 CT 的敏感度中位数是百分之九十七。|The guideline's median sensitivity for initial CT in adults was 97%.|成人初始 C T 的敏感度中位数是百分之九十七。
5|ctEvidence|一项成人多层增强 CT 研究也超过百分之九十三。|Sensitivity also exceeded 93% in an adult multislice contrast-enhanced CT study.|一项成人多层增强 C T 研究也超过百分之九十三。
5|triage|外科评估有手术指征且病情允许时，|When the surgical team confirms that early surgery is indicated and feasible,
5|triage|蜂窝织炎性、坏疽性阑尾炎需尽早手术切除。|phlegmonous or gangrenous appendicitis requires early appendectomy.
5|triage|若有局限性脓肿，治疗方式和时机需另行评估。|A contained abscess calls for a separate decision on treatment and timing.
6|months|急性期以变质和渗出为主，增生何时更突出？|Tissue injury and exudation dominate acutely. When does proliferation stand out?
6|months|反复发作转为慢性后，纤维性增生更突出。|Fibrosis becomes more prominent when recurrent inflammation turns chronic.
6|fibrosis|阑尾壁增厚、变硬，粉红的胶原束大量堆积。|The wall becomes thick and firm as pink collagen bundles accumulate.
6|lymph|还可见深紫色圆核的淋巴细胞，|You may also see lymphocytes with dark, round nuclei,
6|lymph|以及核偏在一侧、核旁发亮的浆细胞。|and plasma cells with off-centre nuclei and a pale zone beside them.
6|elective|慢性阑尾炎手术时机的核心原则是：|The key principle for surgery in chronic appendicitis is this.
6|elective|一旦确诊，通常建议在症状缓解期择期切除；|Once confirmed, elective appendectomy is usually advised when symptoms settle.
6|elective|若正处于急性发作期，则视情况急诊手术。|During an acute flare, emergency surgery depends on the clinical situation.
7|recover|从粉白到暗红、灰黄再到焦黑，颜色在报警。|Pale pink, dark red, grey-yellow and black tell a story of inflammation.
7|call|腹痛移到右下腹，尤其还发烧、按压疼，|If pain moves to the lower right abdomen, especially with fever or tenderness,
7|call|别硬扛，也别等它自己过去。请尽快就医。|Don't wait for it to pass. Seek medical care promptly.
